---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout page="home" title="Connectivity Care Solutions | NDIS disability support in Eleebana, NSW" description="Personalised NDIS disability support in Eleebana, NSW. Support coordination, daily living, community access, respite and more.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="heart-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg></div>
    <div class="wrap hero-inner center">
      <h1>Care that keeps you connected <span>to the life you love</span></h1>
      <p class="tagline">Personalised NDIS support for young people, older people and people with disability. We work with you and your family to build support around your goals, your routines and your plan.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
      <ul class="assurances">
        <li><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg>Registered NDIS provider</li>
        <li><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>Based in Eleebana, NSW</li>
        <li><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Supporting participants since 2022</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="intro-card">
        <h2>Everyone's support looks different</h2>
        <p>Connectivity Care Solutions recognises each person's individuality. We believe there's a personalised care solution for everyone, and we work within the NDIS framework to find it together.</p>
        <p>Our aim is simple: better health outcomes, more comfort, and a life lived with respect and dignity. We're open about how we work, and we take your privacy seriously.</p>
        <p>We're building a community where participants, families and professional carers work toward shared goals, and where everyone is supported to thrive.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <svg class="wave hero-wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 120" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#ffffff" d="M0 120V44c180 48 340 56 520 28S900 14 1080 26s240 34 360 48v46z" opacity=".55"/></svg>
  </section>

  <section aria-label="Why families choose us">
    <div class="why-row">
      <div class="why-panel bg-coral">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why families choose us</p>
        <h2>Personalised care</h2>
        <p>Every person is different, so every support plan is too. We take the time to understand what you need and what matters to you.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="why-media"><img src="/images/garden_smile.jpg" alt="Planting seedlings in a raised garden bed" style="object-position:55% 42%"></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="why-row">
      <div class="why-panel bg-coral-light">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why families choose us</p>
        <h2>Experienced team</h2>
        <p>Our dependable team of support professionals brings years of experience across disability and care services.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="why-media"><img src="/images/drill.jpg" alt="A woman with a cordless drill and tool belt, ready for jobs around the home" style="object-position:50% 40%"></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="why-row">
      <div class="why-panel bg-hot">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why families choose us</p>
        <h2>Community focused</h2>
        <p>People thrive when they feel connected. We help you stay involved in the community around you.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="why-media"><img src="/images/garden_root.jpg" alt="Pulling out an old root while clearing a backyard garden" style="object-position:40% 50%"></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="why-row">
      <div class="why-panel bg-pink">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why families choose us</p>
        <h2>Flexible services</h2>
        <p>Your needs can change, and your support should keep up. We shape our services around what's right for you.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="why-media"><img src="/images/swing2.jpg" alt="Swinging at a beachside playground on a sunny afternoon" style="transform:scale(1.35);transform-origin:42% 52%"></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-offered">
    <div class="wrap so-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>How we can help</h2>
        <p class="lede">From help around the house to getting out in the community, every support is shaped around the person receiving it.</p>
        <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-white" href="/services">View all services</a></div>
      </div>
      <ul class="so-links">
        <li><a href="/services#svc-support-coordination"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>NDIS Support Coordination</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-daily-living"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Assistance with daily living</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-independent-living"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Supported independent living</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-community-access"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Community access and group activities</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-short-medium-stay"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Short and medium stay accommodation</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-in-home"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>In-home services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-shopping-domestic"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Shopping and domestic duties</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-appointments"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Getting to appointments</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-respite"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Respite</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gallery-section">
    <div class="heart-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">Everyday moments that matter</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Beach walks, park days, gardening and coffee catch-ups. This is what support looks like for the people we work with.</p>
      <ul class="gallery" tabindex="0" aria-label="Photos from days out in the community">
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/beach_fence.jpg" alt="A smiling man standing by a fence overlooking the beach on a sunny day" style="object-position:50% 35%"></div><figcaption>Fresh air by the beach</figcaption></figure></li>
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/bench.jpg" alt="A man in a cap and sunglasses sitting on a bench by the water" style="object-position:50% 45%"></div><figcaption>Sunny days by the water</figcaption></figure></li>
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/sunset.jpg" alt="A walk along the beach at sunset" style="object-position:60% 60%"></div><figcaption>Beach walks at sunset</figcaption></figure></li>
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/swing1.jpg" alt="Relaxing on a basket swing at the park" style="transform:scale(1.9);transform-origin:46% 47%"></div><figcaption>Afternoons at the park</figcaption></figure></li>
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/garden_bed.jpg" alt="Planting lettuce and seedlings in a covered garden bed" style="object-position:45% 50%"></div><figcaption>Getting the garden growing</figcaption></figure></li>
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/cafe.jpg" alt="A man smiling at an outdoor café table" style="object-position:50% 45%"></div><figcaption>Catching up over coffee</figcaption></figure></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="heart-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Ready to start your NDIS journey?</h2>
      <p>Get in touch to learn more about our support services and how we can help you reach your goals.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
